  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Hartwick College is a private liberal arts college located in Oneonta, New York, in the foothills of the Catskill Mountains. Hartwick offers undergraduate programmes across the arts, sciences, social sciences, and more.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>Hartwick provides you with student support through personalised admissions guidance and financial aid options. Moreover, you can choose from more than 60 student clubs and organisations.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>Hartwick College offers a fully residential community. You’ll find a variety of housing choices, including traditional residence halls, suite-style rooms, townhouses, and apartment-style options.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><i>If you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to </i><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\"><i>download our app</i></a><i> and check out the Stays feature!</i></p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>On campus, you’ll find the Stevens-German Library, with several study spaces and extensive library resources.</p><p><strong>Sports</strong><br>The college has several sports facilities, such as gyms and fitness centres, soccer fields, and more. You can participate in many sports like basketball, cross country, soccer, and more.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>Hartwick College features specialised labs like its Nursing Simulation Labs (Clark Simulation Lab and hospital wing for realistic training), a unique Baking Innovation Lab (BIL) for food science, a Medical Laboratory, and more such facilities.</p><p><strong>Cafeteria</strong><br>At Hartwick College, you can get fresh food from the Commons dining hall, Table Rock Cafe, and John Christopher's Cafe.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
